Each 15-minute episode features the adventures of Davey Hansen and his "talking" dog Goliath as they learn Christian doctrine through everyday occurrences.', NULL, NULL, 3.3805, 6.25, 0, 1.02, '2026-07-29 20:51:09', '2026-07-29 20:51:09');
